docs/error-codes.md:64:Bridge `LBR-AGENT-024..038` errors are **frame errors**: `libra agent bridge --stdio` answers them as JSON-RPC 2.0 error frames on stdout and keeps serving the next NDJSON line — the bridge process does not exit with `128`. Their exit-code column is marked `frame` accordingly. `LBR-AGENT-039..040` remain reserved for the retired controlled-fix execution outcomes and still map to exit `128`.
